{"v":4,"catch":"在滑稽的動作冒險中迷失自我！","desc":"《DON DOKO DON》是TAITO於1989年發售的一款固定畫面動作遊戲。\n控制老伐木工人Bob和Jim，通過各種棘手的階段。\n撿起物品來加電，在每回合結束時打敗老闆，解救被俘的國王和公主！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-02-24","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b4ae747a3de1476288665917488b4f54e601572e66a6a4e3d2db71a3fe0a45a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b0b31c6b91537617850b83f72b97c53504db38fabc5e01b32e09c1006304e52.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb23e971e3230ccbf60bf51614d4c86244f363ed94c8fa4984cd7abf976b5a94.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/553f957629b3540bac5b7636e2dd92c1e347a29c383622cad3cbea401c1dcff6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7df6ea54dbd7a76a253a6883dc3788e3c9290198e0140e155d33754147947e1b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b297fcb80f2332c7cdebfae66ceac34985484429cbf29114f249c67313c50cc3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b6201a2aa000","dlc":[]}